  m_Name: Kevin Diary
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DiaryData
  transcriptId: 11d81361-c944-477e-b656-eff056cd85c3
  title: Kevin's Diary
  mission: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8c719be39ce71654dad46fa3a0a7cd2e, type: 2}
  OnTranscriptClosed:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  diaryTitle: 
  leftTextBox: "Tried looking for it again, no luck. I thought I caught a glimpse
    of it up in some trees, but when I tried getting closer it wasn\u2019t there.
    I know it\u2019s probably stupid that I care about it so much. I mean, it\u2019s
    just an old art project. It\u2019s just\u2026 going so far away for college is
    a little scary, I guess. \r\n\r\nDon\u2019t get me wrong, I\u2019m excited. And
    of course, I can't wait to finally be studying what I actually want to. But a
    whole new state, whole new group of people, living with roommates for the first
    time, it\u2019s a lot. It\u2019d be nice to have a little piece of home, of my
    childhood, to take with me.\r\n\r\n"
  rightTextBox: "It was stupid trying to fly it around the neighborhood one last
    time. Especially with how windy it was. Honestly, I wouldn\u2019t be surprised
    if it\u2019s just blown away. Ugh, but I\u2019m sure I saw it\u2026 I might check
    one last time later today. But for now, I gotta pack. I really hope it\u2019s
    not gone."
  imageToShow: {fileID: 0}
  imageSize: {x: 215, y: 215}
